    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#### AI is rapidly transforming nearly every industry by increasing productivity and reshaping how work gets done, especially in writing, research, data analysis, and other computer-based tasks.\r\n\r\n#### Rather than replacing jobs entirely, AI is most often used to automate repetitive work, assist with first drafts, and provide feedback or corrections, enabling people to work more efficiently and focus on higher-level thinking across industries.\r\n\r\n#### Below are a few examples of how AI is already being used across industries to increase efficiency and support higher-level work:\r\n* #### Business and Marketing: AI drafts emails and marketing copy, analyzes customer data, and generates insights for faster decision-making.\r\n* #### Software Development and IT: AI helps write and debug code, generate documentation, identify bugs, and improve system performance.\r\n* #### Science and Research: AI processes large datasets, summarizes research, identifies patterns, and accelerates discovery.\r\n\r\n#### However, with these benefits come important responsibilities. To prepare students for a future workforce that heavily incorporates AI, education systems must teach not only how to use AI tools, but also how they work, including their limitations, risks, and potential biases.\r\n\r\n#### Watch the video below to learn more about the impact AI is having on industry.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<details style=\"background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;\">\r\n    <summary style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;\">📝 Key Points from the Video</summary>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;\">\r\n    <p>\r\n\r\n#### AI is impacting the following fields...\r\n* #### Education: AI can function as an equalizer, potentially reducing disparities in learning opportunities and resources.\r\n* #### Healthcare: In the medical field, AI is being leveraged to develop new drugs and improve diagnostics, enhancing patient care.\r\n* #### Science and Technology: AI assists in advancing scientific research and technology development, speeding up innovations.\r\n\r\n#### While AI offers considerable benefits, it is crucial to consider the associated risks and consequences of its deployment, ensuring responsible and ethical use.\r\n\r\n</p></div>\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n"
  },
